  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "FixedLengthOptions.IsRaggedRight reads ragged-right fixed-length files: every column but the last has a fixed width and the last runs from its offset to the end of the record, however long or short. A record that ends before the last column is read as far as it goes, a window it ends inside taking the characters present and a window it never reaches being null. IsLongRecordRejected has no effect alongside it. When writing, the last column is written as formatted, neither padded nor truncated. Defaults to false; existing behaviour unchanged. Source-compatible with 7.2.0.",
